# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile. Without this, `COPY . /src` ships the
# whole history and every local artefact into the image layer.
#
# Two things must NOT be excluded, both load-bearing for the build:
#   README.md      - pyproject.toml declares it as the package readme, so
#                    `pip install /src` fails without it.
#   deploy/        - the Dockerfile copies deploy/entrypoint.sh.
.git
.github
*.egg-info
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/
tests/
docs/
sandbox/
